  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEjbeyROSZskrzilZEPMa8im6JLN_xXX3sDDbjY_XbfEST1kakf4weZq_PgH47GqHEr4wyP6YJE6cf3t8QFQpka4_E0WGns2qESkgGmiNzP7ewWoxntuQLG2v2NBvU34w6cDdNZlC3lkttZMBatmu9vfeaV1yInebRcTy1F9l95bbZauCG4dzEnvoYR3Mw=s1424\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1424\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEjbeyROSZskrzilZEPMa8im6JLN_xXX3sDDbjY_XbfEST1kakf4weZq_PgH47GqHEr4wyP6YJE6cf3t8QFQpka4_E0WGns2qESkgGmiNzP7ewWoxntuQLG2v2NBvU34w6cDdNZlC3lkttZMBatmu9vfeaV1yInebRcTy1F9l95bbZauCG4dzEnvoYR3Mw=w450-h640\" width=\"450\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><p></p><h3 style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">封面作品</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2021/12/bong333_21.html\" target=\"_blank\">玉山之春</a></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><br /></div><h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2021/12/bong333-e.html\" target=\"_blank\">編輯室ê話</a></span></h3><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><br /></div></span></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><h3><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">做伙來唸詩</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">陳昭蓉<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2021/12/blog-post_29.html\" target=\"_blank\">新鞋</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>1</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">郭伊貞<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2021/12/sap-sap.html\" target=\"_blank\">Sap-sap仔雨</a></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">2</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">蕭聿萱<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2021/12/ti-tsia-e.html\" target=\"_blank\">留tī tsia--ê</a></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">4</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">林智美<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2021/12/blog-post_30.html\" target=\"_blank\">中秋</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>6</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">黃成保<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2021/12/e_30.html\" target=\"_blank\">我ê老爸</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>6</span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">台語sa攏有講座</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">主講／謝一麟</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">記錄／張翠硯</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2021/12/blog-post_55.html\" target=\"_blank\">風景走過我</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>8</span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">台文通訊30歲</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">主持／陳豐惠</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">記錄／吳宛霖</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2021/12/blog-post_77.html\" target=\"_blank\">做伙來行台語路</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>11</span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">講古hōo lín聽</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">實齋<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2022/01/blog-post.html\" target=\"_blank\">應聲蟲</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>13</span></div><h4><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">台灣人寫真</span></h4><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">張寶明<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2022/01/leh-tsih-tsuh-kap.html\" target=\"_blank\">我leh tsih-tsuh kap作孽</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>14</span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Lán來講看māi</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">姚文崧<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2022/01/blog-post_4.html\" target=\"_blank\">用母語號名建立身份認同</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>16</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">張顥瀗<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2022/01/blog-post_24.html\" target=\"_blank\">一个少年家看肺炎病毒影響台灣</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>17</span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">阿瑞--ā話仙</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">藍春瑞<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2022/01/e-tang-pinn.html\" target=\"_blank\">寒--人ē-tàng pìnn啥</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>19</span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">心內話</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">阿表<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2022/01/khioh.html\" target=\"_blank\">Khioh字紙揣寶</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>20</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">朱子宏<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2021/12/e_21.html\" target=\"_blank\">開設台語友善門診ê起見</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>22</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">李家銘<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2022/01/e.html\" target=\"_blank\">我學台語ê原因</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>23</span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">文學káng「台」</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">石牧民<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2022/01/etsang.html\" target=\"_blank\">台灣文學、台語文學ê「現代」tsáng頭（一）</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>24</span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">農民食堂</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">主講／林大米</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;吳俊擇</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;吳建隆</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">記錄／戴如意<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2022/01/e-e.html\" target=\"_blank\">「平和e米廠」吳--家爸仔囝ê傳承記錄</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>26</span></div><h4><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Sann-kap讀小說&nbsp;</span></h4><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">張家榮<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2022/01/e_6.html\" target=\"_blank\">玄奇ê囡仔仙（十八）</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>28</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">杜信龍<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2022/01/blog-post_6.html\" target=\"_blank\">情刀（四）</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>32</span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Bóng講笑</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">黃靜惠<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2022/01/kap.html\" target=\"_blank\">白痴——「牛屎kap蛇精」笑詼輯（六）</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>36<br /></span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">逐家來phò-tāu&nbsp;</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Kua Tsì-kia̍t</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2022/01/ti.html\" target=\"_blank\">Tī厝內上班</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>37</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">江宥呈<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2022/01/blog-post_7.html\" target=\"_blank\">行行出狀元</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>37</span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">寫hō͘學生朋友ê代誌</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">陳雷<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2022/01/ayapae.html\" target=\"_blank\">Ayapa話死ê時</a></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2022/01/ayapae.html\" target=\"_blank\">Ayapa-ōe Sí ê Sî</a></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">38</span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">台羅會交流道</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Âng Ek-sim<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2022/01/so-ji-koa.html\" target=\"_blank\">Sò͘-jī Koa</a></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">40</span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Lán來講看māi</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Khó͘ Pōe-bín<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2022/01/blog-post_18.html\" target=\"_blank\">妖獸家長</a></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">42</span></div><div><br /></div></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEj3NI4C2SUP8VNB8JyOd61FQjKHpP5Sex5x_oUgByisYOR1VMxgLkEBNXuXl7j5eu6F2dVZX-TpQ22uctQzFI4lckyveey4xGrY46vaIE8XDZW3otKhM_St7R8RMKlciyOlO8h68DyqULV2ATOey4WNHXMcUBTToZexbga9G52jLwfkyejV6TJKLi38lA=s1420\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1420\" data-original-width=\"1001\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEj3NI4C2SUP8VNB8JyOd61FQjKHpP5Sex5x_oUgByisYOR1VMxgLkEBNXuXl7j5eu6F2dVZX-TpQ22uctQzFI4lckyveey4xGrY46vaIE8XDZW3otKhM_St7R8RMKlciyOlO8h68DyqULV2ATOey4WNHXMcUBTToZexbga9G52jLwfkyejV6TJKLi38lA=w452-h640\" width=\"452\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEjEYUZDIY2hlypvG6hennQHikI1f02ir9D9dEb5YgRnI1Hb1hV7L2cwey0Uli_XD6WqtJ9fsLZ4D0m-LQy2qhLlWOIaTHRB9lNnsDXgg-rjSo8XvYoYIxTE1ZFMEb_Py4N1MWNmVUhVM1hqya7tlGSs9SmOBdOzWKi4YGTeyJ0R5RVeN9AExcimHrNf7A=s3036\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEjEYUZDIY2hlypvG6hennQHikI1f02ir9D9dEb5YgRnI1Hb1hV7L2cwey0Uli_XD6WqtJ9fsLZ4D0m-LQy2qhLlWOIaTHRB9lNnsDXgg-rjSo8XvYoYIxTE1ZFMEb_Py4N1MWNmVUhVM1hqya7tlGSs9SmOBdOzWKi4YGTeyJ0R5RVeN9AExcimHrNf7A=w454-h640\" width=\"454\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhRnPsFES0g811ZL6gVA7Eb-qXB_uo3fs06c6UWCEc9lz2aSNoKYu8Jtm9eccWn8RstuKiyrN-thShssBMrFxKABwc32N04YN3Aw1jKnwE5XrEpkSIvRsTc5bTPVWnVK0_LKEiVHEPgzZXOOaQnUrE_T4YltDM8-JC1a__AQtgugLYvnZQCHFJPYWKsQA=s1418\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1418\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhRnPsFES0g811ZL6gVA7Eb-qXB_uo3fs06c6UWCEc9lz2aSNoKYu8Jtm9eccWn8RstuKiyrN-thShssBMrFxKABwc32N04YN3Aw1jKnwE5XrEpkSIvRsTc5bTPVWnVK0_LKEiVHEPgzZXOOaQnUrE_T4YltDM8-JC1a__AQtgugLYvnZQCHFJPYWKsQA=w452-h640\" width=\"452\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEj8n0btWi5L7bM_hc9o2n0IJxTcoNBkUEMXxKmFhUN5ZMIOHFrrmkJCmnK0_rng6XOVK0W1DE6pNc8F2p9BOdgNmY4NO-db0iFXO6_OzxW5Pmd3a_bg7IVUoEE91qF4sVgaDaKyPk_sGnCQRrxtSta7oU44c_4LgBaB_J3LdVLi3uauuLVwFz-hNkw9Ag=s1424\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1424\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEj8n0btWi5L7bM_hc9o2n0IJxTcoNBkUEMXxKmFhUN5ZMIOHFrrmkJCmnK0_rng6XOVK0W1DE6pNc8F2p9BOdgNmY4NO-db0iFXO6_OzxW5Pmd3a_bg7IVUoEE91qF4sVgaDaKyPk_sGnCQRrxtSta7oU44c_4LgBaB_J3LdVLi3uauuLVwFz-hNkw9Ag=w450-h640\" width=\"450\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><p></p><div align=\"center\"><div style=\"background-color: white; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px;\"><h3 style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #274e13; text-align: justify; white-space: pre-wrap;\">歡迎捐款贊助　#李江却台語文教基金會　</span></span></h3><h3 style=\"text-align: left;\"><div style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #274e13; font-size: large; text-align: justify; white-space: pre-wrap;\">（捐款可抵稅，匯款後請通知02-23112199）</span></div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><div style=\"color: #274e13; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span></div><span style=\"color: #38761d;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; text-align: justify; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span>線上捐款(定期定額) </span><a href=\"https://donate.newebpay.com/Period/akhioh/lkk\" target=\"_blank\">https://donate.newebpay.com/Period/akhioh/lkk</a></div></span><span style=\"text-align: justify;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span></div><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span>線上捐款(單筆) </span><a href=\"https://donate.newebpay.com/akhioh/lkk\" target=\"_blank\">https://donate.newebpay.com/akhioh/lkk</a></div></span></span></span><span style=\"color: #274e13; text-align: justify;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"text-align: center; white-space: pre-wrap;\">郵政劃撥：19021486</div><div style=\"text-align: center; white-space: pre-wrap;\">戶名：財團法人李江却台語文教基金會</div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span></div><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\">電匯：123-20-050514-2</div><div style=\"text-align: center;\">華南銀行士林分行活儲</div></span><div style=\"text-align: center; white-space: pre-wrap;\">戶名：財團法人李江却台語文教基金會</div></span></span></h3><div style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #050505; text-align: justify; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span></span></div><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; text-align: left;\"></span></div><div style=\"background-color: white; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px;\"><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: 15px;\"><br /></span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"></div><div style=\"text-align: start;\"><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #999999;\">李江却台語文教基金會需要你ê定期捐款，逐個月捐助NT$200以上，lán做伙來推動復振台灣語文ê事工，歡迎利用劃撥、電匯、信用卡、郵局『存簿儲金自動轉帳』扣款iah是線頂捐款、現金贊助。</span><br /><span style=\"color: #999999;\"><br /></span></span></div></div><div style=\"text-align: start;\"><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #999999; font-size: medium;\"></span></div></div><div style=\"text-align: start;\"><div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #999999;\">◎逐個月贊助本會（台文通訊BONG報發行單位）NT$200（iah是逐冬NT$2,400）以上，</span><span style=\"color: #999999;\">做伙支持基金會事工kap雜誌編印發行費用。歡迎利用郵局劃撥、信用卡（寫捐款單）、線頂捐款、現金贊助、銀行/ATM轉帳（轉帳了後請通知）、支票、郵局戶頭自動轉帳扣繳（寫授權書），捐款收據ē-tàng做『列舉扣除額』抵稅ê用途。</span></span></div></div></div></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div>"
